  "provenance": [
    "Mirror-only extension of the finite model coordinates; production command composition remains excluded.",
    "Mixable normal 27a5ecc and copy 27a6958 retain nonliteral/nonbranch instruction bodies, including seed property stores and caller SP frame sizes. Program constructors 28d49a4/28d415c and nested wrappers are caller-linked by model-310.py. Seed stack return words point just after those BLs, not to similar unused closures.",
    "Track constructor 29d0c40 contains the name field construction at 29d0e5c and Armable constructor BL 29d0e70 ->292ec64; returned LR 29d0e74. Color final two stores occur at 29d11f4, four bytes earlier relative to function start than in 3.9.1. Track name/color/arm properties retain +440/+5f0/+474 and color +618.",
    "Property destructor 223d974 is an interior function in exidx [223d7e8,223dea4); identical entry pair, 25285 paired constructor/destructor BL witnesses from old1efc91c select this interior, not neighboring identical cleanup blocks.",
    "Project constructor 2915e6c calls Automation constructor2693d34 at29164f0 and stores returned allocation at Project+b34 at29164f8. Exception cleanup reads b34 at291709c and invokes deleting destructor. Full Project destructor is retained by base profile.",
    "Selection constructor 28ff648 retains the publication pair at28ff7a8; changed trailing code does not move this pair. Selection setter100e430 commit100e4ac selected by22 paired BL witnesses; bool settereaaae0 commit eaab5c selected by72 paired BL witnesses. Representative paired call sites are pinned in calls below, with complete new caller function guards; native calls are not executed by the component.",
    "Muteable normal268d4f8/copy268db64 retain all nonliteral/nonbranch instructions and field offsets; mirror hook pairs correspond to mute/solo/audio-solo/effective fields. Their parent Mixable BLs return27a5f70/27a69d4.",
    "Blank-create coordinates are prepared for the existing command source, but the 59-site mirror profile does not install those two command hooks. MpcEngine ctor fefad0 forms primary vptr from literalff0014 +PC(fefbd8+8)+118 =6ce5650; stores16-byte ProjectCreator at+258. Creator constructor292340c stores MpcEngine at+8. Destructorffccac reaches cleanup atffff0c, which reads+258. Old constructor e39d94 stored+240.",
    "The NewProject selector moves from oldr3 to original callerSP+0 in3.10. Selected-empty119c97c stores1 atSP+0; automaticstartupfeb5d8 stores0. Dispatcher2923498 frame58 passes ownSP+58 to binder292b150, whose initial ldr lr,[r1] copies the word. Callback2923dcc reads it throughr1 into r7 and passesr7 inr1 to ffbd3c at three pinned calls. This is a source selector, not a universal human-intent test.",
    "Createffbd3c retains frame128/savedLR11c and r4 MpcEngine at ordinary ready pairffc034. It calls Project initialization2913bf0 atffbfbc and page setter165b278 atffc004 before that return. These native bodies are statically pinned, not executed by the mirror component.",
    "Pending Editor D1 return307 at2eabb78 follows native holder drain/wait at2eab990 and the last base destructor call2eabb74->2d458d4. At the hook r5 retains originalEditor; remaining code restores registers and returns. Oldequivalent2c6f834. Separate queue trace supplies holder cancellation semantics; this site is not installed by mirror preparation."
  ],
